OL,3,ARwanda's army team removed from Africa
OL,4,Aleague after US sanctions, NBA says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe National Basketball Association
OL,7,F(NBA) says it removed Rwanda's army
OL,8,Fteam from its African league because of
OL,9,FUS sanctions imposed on the country in
OL,10,FMarch.
OL,12,FThe NBA had previously said the Rwandan
OL,13,Farmy-funded Armee Patriotique Rwandaise
OL,14,F(APR) club would not participate in the
OL,15,F2026 Basketball Africa League (BAL).
OL,17,FHowever this is the first time the NBA
OL,18,Fhas revealed the reasons behind the
OL,19,FAPR's removal.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
