OL,3,ARwanda's army team removed from Africa
OL,4,Aleague after US sanctions, NBA says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe association was responding to
OL,7,Fcomplaints by two US senators, who sent
OL,8,Fa letter asking them to reconsider
OL,9,Ftheir partnership with the Rwandan
OL,10,Fteam. The US placed sanctions on the
OL,11,FRwandan army, accusing it of fuelling
OL,12,Fthe conflict in the Democratic Republic
OL,13,Fof Congo in March.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
